{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36799","headline":"黄鹤驿寓题 · 罗隐","name":"黄鹤驿寓题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野云芳草绕离鞭，敢对青楼倚少年。\n秋色未催榆塞鴈，人心先下洞庭船。\n高歌酒市非狂者，大嚼屠门亦偶然。\n车马同归莫同恨，古人头白尽林泉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36799.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36799","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}